# packages/db

- Schema in `src/schema.ts`; `pnpm db:generate` for migrations, never by hand. CI fails on drift.
- Localized text columns are `jsonb` `Localized` (`fr` required). Prices are integer minor units.
- `src/seed/catalogue.ts` is the PDF catalogue (30 products; TND prices are placeholders = EUR x 3.4 rounded to 5 DT, stock
  is a placeholder). `scenario.ts` builds deterministic demo orders. `seed()` never overwrites a non-empty database.
- `password.ts` is node:crypto scrypt (runs on Bun, Node and Vercel).
- Product variants (`product_variants`): a product with variants takes price and stock from the chosen variant; its own price and stock become the lowest price and total stock (set on every admin save by `lib/variants.ts`). Order items keep `variantId` and the label in the title. Admin saves upsert variants by id so held stock never loses its link.
